# Kept out of the build context. .venv is excluded on uv's instruction: "It is best
# practice to add .venv to a .dockerignore file in your repository to prevent it
# from being included in image builds. The project virtual environment is dependent
# on your local platform and should be created from scratch in the image."
# (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/guides/integration/docker/). The rest is what the
# buildpack project descriptor used to exclude, plus build noise.
.venv
tests
.pytest_cache
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
.git
